      "id": 1,
      "text": "Glorieta sprang to life in 1879 when the New Mexico and Southern Pacific Railroad reached the pass, and a post office opened the next year.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
